# The build context is the repository's inputs, never its outputs.
#
# `target/` alone is tens of gigabytes and would be copied into the build
# context on every image build; the `.lexlean/` build roots are live output
# that the committed `expected/` oracles already stand for (§28.3).
/target/
**/target/
**/.lexlean/
/release/
/.git/
